RF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, October to November is the driest pair on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Bulloch County, and it came in under 90% of normal in 42 of 75 years since 1951. In 2025 that pair came in at 45% of normal on the middle, and September to October was 44%. So far in 2026, March to April on the middle came in at 16% of normal. Grid 15192 had its driest year in 1954 at 53% of normal.</p>"}
